<http://digistrucmed.org/grade-record/lu_d30b2e95fb9d7d7778de8f39f87fde424e1edcdcec29e5931d37a4644749a1db_n0077/gr_0025> <http://digistrucmed.org/gradingSystemName> "ESC Class of Recommendation" .
